/T (This comprehensive technical blueprint serves as a definitive, beginner-friendly operational guide. It explains how high-volume public text datasets are programmatically harvested \(Data Scraping\), processed into structured formats via Natural Language Processing \(NLP\), evaluated utilizing supervised Machine Learning frameworks, and contextualized over rigorous chronological timelines \(Trend Analysis\). Ultimately, this report bridges the knowledge gap for incoming engineering cohorts, providing a complete conceptual lifecycle initialization framework.)
